I'm not terribly fond of you, but I need any help I can get. Our eggs are being stolen by these Twilight invaders. I have no doubt that they want to take them back to Grim Batol to experiment on and pervert. I will NOT let that happen. If you truly do want to help us, stop them! Recover the eggs. Bring them back to me.", ["objectivesText"] = "Recover 6 Vermillion Eggs . Progress: Twilight dragons were born of these disgusting experiments of theirs. The Twilight's Hammer have gone too far. Deathwing has gone too far.", ["rewardGold"] = 309800, ["rewardXP"] = 4115, ["rewardItems"] = { 61317 }, ["starts"] = { { ["mapID"] = 241, ["npcID"] = 45518, ["x"] = 0.292, ["y"] = 0.26 } }, ["ends"] = { { ["mapID"] = 241, ["npcID"] = 45518, ["x"] = 0.292, ["y"] = 0.26 } }, ["coords"] = { ["mapID"] = 241, ["source"] = "quest_giver", ["x"] = 0.292, ["y"] = 0.26 }, ["mapCandidates"] = { ["npc"] = { 241 }, ["zone"] = { 4922 } }, ["questType"] = "standard", ["sourceQuests"] = { 27564 }, ["questLines"] = { { ["id"] = 546, ["name"] = "Twilight Highlands", ["orderIndex"] = 159, ["flags"] = 0 } }, ["db2PoiUiMapID"] = 241 },
